          "Multiply top and bottom by $2\\sqrt{x}$: $\\frac{(2x + 5) - 4x}{2\\sqrt{x}(2x + 5)^2} = \\frac{5 - 2x}{2\\sqrt{x}(2x + 5)^2}$.",
